# For - EdgeQL | Reference | Gel Docs
created: undefined, last updated: 2026-05-29, [Read more](https://docs.geldata.com/reference/edgeql/for)

Instead of literal sets, it's common to use a json parameter for bulk inserts.
This value is then "unpacked" into a set of `json` elements and used inside the `for` loop:
…
```
with
raw_data := <json>$data,
for item in json_array_unpack(raw_data) union (
insert Hero { name := <str>item['name'] }
);
```
